r it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"},"490":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-24","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"},"491":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-25","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"},"492":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-26","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"Built on React Aria - native form integration, validation, focus management, and screen-reader support"},"493":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-27","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"Label formatting via `formatOptions` / `placeholder` on the picker itself, or on `DatePickerValue` / `DateRangePickerValue` in a trigger you write"},"494":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-28","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"},"495":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-29","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#working-with-dates","content":"Values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"},"496":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-30","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#working-with-dates","content":"Import date helpers from `@godaddy/antares/date` (a re-export of\n`@internationalized/date`).\nWrap the app in `<I18nProvider>` so formatting and the calendar follow the user's locale."},"497":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-31","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#default","content":"A single date picker with a `Label`."},"498":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-32","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#range","content":"A start/end range picker."},"499":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-33","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#controlled","content":"Driving the value with `useState`."},"500":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-34","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#format-options","content":"Controlling the trigger's label format via `formatOptions`."},"501":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-35","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#min--max","content":"Bounding selectable dates with `minValue` / `maxValue`."},"502":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-36","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#with-error","content":"An invalid picker showing a validation message via `isInvalid` and a `FieldError`."},"503":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-37","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#disabled","content":"A disabled picker via `isDisabled`."},"504":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-38","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#composed","content":"Write the trigger and the overlay yourself instead of composing `DatePickerCalendar`, for full\ncontrol over the popover and the calendar."},"505":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-39","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#composed-range","content":"Write a DateRangePicker's trigger and overlay from lower-level pieces the same way."},"506":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-40","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#sizes","content":"`size` sets the label, trigger, and calendar. Without it, the picker follows the surrounding\nsize scope."},"507":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"page","content":"Drawer","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer"},"508":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge, supporting sidebar navigation and bottom sheets."},"509":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#installation","content":"Installation"},"510":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#examples","content":"Examples"},"511":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#default","content":"Default"},"512":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#bottom-sheet","content":"Bottom Sheet"},"513":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"Placements"},"514":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-