h debouncing (15ms)"],[1769,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1845,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1875,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1872,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1316,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1317,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1404,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[264,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1906,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1838,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1352,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[834,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[490,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1639,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[975,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1355,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1746,"**Space / Enter**"],[1195,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[263,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[882,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1320,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[724,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[734,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1411,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[974,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1880,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1869,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[674,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[718,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1742,"**Tab**"],[262,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1192,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1318,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1682,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1680,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1681,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1147,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1738,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1737,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1884,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1873,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[733,"**Trade-offs:**"],[675,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[489,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1350,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[885,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[2060,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[669,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1847,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[2124,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[736,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[737,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[747,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[978,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1354,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1638,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[976,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1902,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1839,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1878,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1848,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[723,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1468,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1465,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1474,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1475,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1463,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1469,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1472,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1466,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1478,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[172,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[2103,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2105,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2099,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[2101,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[2106,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[2102,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[2100,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[2104,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[2056,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[605,"`a