ne and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1133,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[698,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[701,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[697,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[699,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[700,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[702,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1456,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[491,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[1606,"`Detail` is supporting copy, such as captions and metadata, on the detail ramp. It keeps the\nsurrounding color; add `emphasis=\"passive\"` to mute it."],[525,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[619,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1597,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1605,"`emphasis` selects a feedback color and changes nothing else. Without it, text inherits the\nsurrounding color."],[1024,"`Enter/Space`"],[60,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[449,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[567,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[792,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[534,"`Escape`"],[950,"`Escape`"],[1026,"`Escape`"],[1801,"`Escape`"],[604,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is